 ],
 "description": "Copy of \"anchor: concurrent unique names\" that sends resource_type when it creates a role or permission. It replaces the original once ADR-0022 PR 1 is deployed. anchor#237 concurrent same-name creates: 3 sibling writers each for an organization API key, a workspace, a product role and a resource permission (mixed case) answer 201 or 409, never 500; searches count one key and one workspace; a late serial create of each name answers 409 with its domain code. anchor#240: 3 sibling publishes of one email template (200 or 409), then the draft reads and updates (200) and the template points at it. Own product without event endpoint, deleted always. Generator: echopoint-investigation/gen_unique_names.py.",
 "updated_at": "2026-10-30T18:23:51.757679Z",
